                    <h1 class="font-display text-[34px] leading-[1.12] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.02em] text-balance md:text-[42px] capitalize">What&#039;s new<span class="text-accent">.</span></h1>
                    <p class="max-w-[560px] text-[16px] leading-[1.7] text-muted text-pretty">
        Every release, newest first. Releases up to 1.15 are grouped by minor version.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3.5">
                    <article class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[18px] border border-white/8 bg-panel p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/16 sm:p-6">
                <h2 class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                    <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent-soft">1.18.0</span>
                                            <span class="font-display text-[17px] font-bold capitalize text-foam">Count and measure habits</span>
                                    </h2>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">
                                                                        <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-5 marker:text-faint">
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Choose Yes/No, Count, or Measure habits; track decimal amounts and custom units</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Changing a habit&#039;s type keeps past days and streaks intact</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Count goals above 1: tapping at the goal opens the value editor instead of clearing</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">New iOS Shortcuts: Log Amount, Log Habit Note, Get Habit Progress, and Open Habit</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Translated Shortcuts labels and clearer behavior for quit habits</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Fixed: Shortcuts no longer reduce over-goal progress; more reliable imports, backups, and purchases</li>
                                                            </ul>
                                                            </div>
                            </article>
                    <article class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[18px] border border-white/8 bg-panel p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/16 sm:p-6">
                <h2 class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                    <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent-soft">1.17.3</span>
                                    </h2>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">
                                                                        <ul class="flex list-disc flex-col gap-2 pl-5 marker:text-faint">
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">HabitKit now speaks Japanese (日本語) and Hebrew (עברית)</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">New switches in Settings: turn off haptics, hide the notes feature, or switch off drag-to-reorder</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Settings are now split into General and Overview, so the overview&#039;s own options are easier to find</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Fixed: long-pressing a habit no longer shows its card twice</li>
                                                                    <li class="text-pretty">Switching a quit habit back to build asks whether to keep or clear its clean days, and locked days now explain themselves</li>
                                                            </ul>
                                                            </div>
                            </article>
                    <article class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-[18px] border border-white/8 bg-panel p-5 transition-colors hover:border-white/16 sm:p-6">
                <h2 class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
                    <span class="font-mono text-[13px] text-accent-soft">1.17.2</span>
                                    </h2>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-[14.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted">
